@startuml uc-customer-patient-management
title UC: Customer / Patient Management
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  ActorBorderColor #0F172A
  ActorBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #0F172A
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  NoteBackgroundColor #FEF9C3
  NoteBorderColor #CA8A04
}

actor "Any authenticated user" as User
participant "POS System" as System

== Profile ==
User -> System : create/edit customer\n(name, phone, dob, allergies, insuranceRef,\ncorporate account, loyalty_points)
System --> User : profile saved

User -> System : view purchase history
System -> System : query paid transactions (status = 1) for customer
System --> User : history, newest first, with loyalty_points_earned per visit

== Loyalty accrual (triggered by a completed sale) ==
participant "Sale Checkout" as Sale
Sale -> System : sale completes as paid, customer != walk-in
System -> System : accrue floor(total * loyalty_earn_rate) points
note right
  Default rate 0.1 (1 point per 10 currency
  units). Points can only be earned today,
  not yet redeemed at checkout.
end note

== Corporate / insurance pricing ==
User -> System : view customer's contracted discount_percent
note over User, System
  Not auto-applied — cashier enters it manually
  as the sale's normal discount, still subject to
  the tiered discount-approval check.
end note

== Exceptions ==
alt delete customer with purchase history
  System --> User : deleted; past transactions NOT anonymized\n(customer id becomes dangling)
end
note over User, System
  Fully offline: profile edits, history reads,
  and loyalty accrual are all local.
end note
@enduml
